# SQLite dev database — never ship local test data to a deploy. Railway
# (or wherever the backend runs) creates a fresh users.db on first boot via
# db.init_db(), backed by a persistent volume so it's the deployment's own
# real data going forward, not a snapshot of local testing.
backend/users.db
backend/users.db-shm
backend/users.db-wal

